& =\frac{\frac{1}{6} \times \frac{2}{3}}{\frac{1}{6} \times \frac{2}{3}+\frac{5}{6} \times \frac{1}{3}}=\frac{2}{7}
\end{aligned}

The probability that it is actually six $=\frac{2}{7}$
The probability that it is not actually six $=1-\frac{2}{7}=\frac{5}{7}$
The probability that is actually five $=\frac{1}{5} \times \frac{5}{7}=\frac{1}{7}$.

